OL,3,GNEWSAI've learned lessons after summer
OL,4,Abudget defeat, Wales' first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister says that his
OL,7,Fgovernment has learned "lessons" after
OL,8,Fhis mid-year spending plans were
OL,9,Fdefeated in the Senedd.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, Rhun ap Iorwerth said
OL,12,Fthat discussions were starting to avoid
OL,13,Fa repeat when the Welsh government
OL,14,Fbudget is discussed next year.
OL,16,FPlaid Cymru's leader promised to
OL,17,F"improve the way we engage with others"
OL,18,Fafter the supplementary budget vote in
OL,19,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
